# Instructions for Cursor Agent

Always follow the architectural rules and project standards defined in `@AGENTS.md`.

Key rules to strictly enforce:
- **Next.js 16 & React 19:** App Router only. Do not use manual `useMemo` or `useCallback`.
- **TypeScript:** Strict type checking. No `any`. Use type narrowing instead of type casting (`as ...`).
- **Imports:** Absolute imports using `@/` alias.
- **Exports:** Prefer named exports (default exports only for Next.js pages/layouts).
- **Environment Variables:** Never read `process.env` directly in application code; use `src/libs/Env.ts`.
- **Styling:** Use Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes.